  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n dibindeki telveler, b\xFCy\xFCkl\xFC k\xFC\xE7\xFCkl\xFC \"\xE7itler\"
    taraf\u0131ndan adeta \xE7evrelenmi\u015F. Fincan taban\u0131n\u0131n tam ortas\u0131n\u0131
    adeta \"d\u0131\u015F d\xFCnyaya kapatan\" bu telveler, hayalindeki ili\u015Fkiyi
    ger\xE7ek k\u0131lmak i\xE7in herhangi bir giri\u015Fimde bulunmad\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131
    s\xF6yl\xFCyor {{isim}}. Kendini {{kelime, yaralanmaktan | h\u0131rpalanmaktan
    | risk alman\u0131 gerektirecek durumlardan | hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131na
    u\u011Framaktan}} korumaya \xE7al\u0131\u015F\u0131rken, hayat\u0131n sana sunmak
    istedi\u011Fi g\xFCzelliklerden mahrum kalm\u0131\u015Fs\u0131n. Demi\u015Fler
    ki: \"Kom\u015Fularla aran\u0131 yapan \xE7itlere bir de kap\u0131 laz\u0131m
    ki dostlar\u0131n i\xE7eri girebilsin.\" Arkada\u015Flar\u0131nla ili\u015Fkilerini
    ilerletmen, sana yeni kap\u0131lar a\xE7acak. Zira bu arkada\u015Flar\u0131ndan
    biri sayesinde, seni adeta tamamlayacak \"o ki\u015Fiyle\" tan\u0131\u015Fman
    kolayla\u015Facak {{isim}}."
